Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:05.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...how long did it take for the roll -skater thing to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:05.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个溜冰鞋的点子才得以实施
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:08.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- About three months. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:08.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-大约三个月  -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.11,0:05:12.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I guess that's about two weeks before the topless thing kicks in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.11,0:05:12.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以离无上装的规定  大约还有两星期
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.81,0:05:19.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got you something. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.81,0:05:19.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我给你买了份礼物  
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:23.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Open it! Open it! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:23.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-打开来看  -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是一只鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:32.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:32.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很可爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys? Do you know anything about chicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两位  你们了解鸡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fowl? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}家禽  不了解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Women? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女人  不了解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}chick有"小鸡"和"女人"两个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:43.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They are a huge responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:43.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}养鸡责任重大
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Especially at this age. They require constant care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尤其是小鸡  他们需要有规律的照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They need just the right food and lots and lots of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它们不能吃错东西  需要很多关爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:52.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well,no problem there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:52.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:05:59.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Easy, Lenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:05:59.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}轻一点  鸡妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:06.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, I mean, have you thought about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:06.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你考虑过了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Not "the thing." I hate "the thing."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要啊  我讨厌你说"是这样的"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:13.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's "the thing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:13.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是怎样的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:16.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:16.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能接受
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:18.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. I wish I could, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  我也很想接受  但...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:21.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you have these feelings for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:21.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你是喜欢我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.51,0:06:23.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, wait, wait. That's what you're worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.51,0:06:23.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等  等等  你在担心这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:26.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If that's the problem, we've got no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:26.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果是这个问题  那就没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:28.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I was gonna tell you over dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:28.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是这样的  我正打算吃饭时告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.73,0:06:31.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I met somebody else, on my trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.73,0:06:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这趟出国认识了一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Her name's Ann. She's a journalist. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她叫安  是名记者 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:36.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We met on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在飞机上认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:37.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She asked me if she could finish off my peanuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:37.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她问我能否把我的花生吃完
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.77,0:06:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought she said something else. We had a big laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.77,0:06:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听成别的  我们大笑一场\N英语中花生的发音与"阴茎"相同
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I just, I mean I got, I got tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是...受够了等待
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's great. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:51.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean I'm-I'm sorry, but I'm so happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:51.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  但我十分为你高兴 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:54.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Now I can work for you! - I guess you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:54.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-现在我可以为你工作了  -看来可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.21,0:06:57.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God! This is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.21,0:06:57.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:06:59.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, y'know what?  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:06:59.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  等着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:03.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna roll right into that office and quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:03.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要溜进办公室去辞职
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:04.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:04.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Could you give me a little push? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可以推我一下吗  -可以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:09.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Good luck! - I'm quitting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:09.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-祝你好运  -我要辞职了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm okay! I'm all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没事  我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's exciting. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:21.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真令人兴奋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You went to Japan, made up a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你去了趟日本  编造了个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:25.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:25.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:29.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just saying, this "woman," I mean, she's fictitious, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:29.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说这个女人...是虚构的  不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Why would you say that? - 'Cause you're still into Monica. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么这么说  -你还是喜欢莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:35.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said there's somebody else so she would agree to work with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:35.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你谎称有了别人  好让她与你共事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:37.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so 'cause you figure, if you spent a lot of time together,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:37.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你觉得  如果相处久了  
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.77,0:07:39.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}maybe something might happen, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.77,0:07:39.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许就会产生感情 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're good. You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真行  你真行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:46.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm fairly intuitive. And psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:46.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是直觉准  还会通灵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.89,0:07:48.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a substantial gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.89,0:07:48.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很实在的天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:53.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen. Can you promise me that you won't tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:53.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听我说  你能答应我不要告诉她吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:56.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Absolutely. I promise. Tell her what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:56.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题  我答应你  告诉她什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:07:58.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:07:58.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:07:59.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:07:59.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  说真的  
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:02.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean I'm intuitive, but my memory sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:02.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然我的直觉很准  但记性很差
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:07.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, but this is the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:07.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  但这是最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:10.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}*With a chick-chick here And a chick-chick there*
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:10.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}*这里有只小小鸡  那里有只小小鸡*
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:13.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}*Here a chick, there a chick Everywhere a chick-chick*
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:13.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}*这只鸡  那只鸡  到处都有小小鸡*
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chicken....
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鸡...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:19.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:19.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鸡妹妹好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:21.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:24.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you think it's a she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不觉得是妹妹吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:25.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:39.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't tell. Whatever it was went back in too quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:39.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看不出来  那个东西一下子就缩回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:41.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I gotta change. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:41.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要换衣服  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:43.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm meeting some of the cast for drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:43.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要去跟其他演员喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:46.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Excuse me? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:46.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么  -怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:47.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I stayed home from work today 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:47.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今天在家呆了一天没上班
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.81,0:08:49.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}while you were at rehearsal...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.81,0:08:49.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好让你在排练时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:51.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so somebody could be here with our chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:51.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能有人陪着我们的小鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.39,0:08:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who was up from 2:00 this morning until 5:00 this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.39,0:08:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是谁从凌晨两点撑到凌晨五点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:58.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...trying to get her back to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就为了要哄她睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:09:00.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't think I get up when you get up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:09:00.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你以为你起来时  我没醒着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:03.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:03.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.19,0:09:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes! Here it comes! I'm stuck here all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.19,0:09:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  又来了  我整天闷在家里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:10.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then you come in and spend two seconds with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:10.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你才回来跟我们呆了几秒钟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:14.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and then expect to go off gallivanting with your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:14.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就要出去跟朋友花天酒地
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.99,0:09:17.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I don't think so, mister!
